<title>GERMANY: Buderus 95/96 net profit steady, dividend up.</title>
<headline>Buderus 95/96 net profit steady, dividend up.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>1995/96 fiscal year to September 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   96.0    vs 95.0</p>
<p>    Group sales				  3,287   vs 3,112</p>
<p>    Dividend				     17	vs 15 marks</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German manufacturer of cast iron and steel products and heating systems is Buderus AG. Buderus also said that its pretax profit rose to 64 million marks in the first quarter of its 1996/97 fiscal year from 57 million in the year-earlier period.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
